cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "exact-exp32: correctly rounded single-precision exponentials, float-only exp2f on GPU, and a GPU genetic-programming search"
authors:
  - family-names: "El Hmissi"
    given-names: "Maher"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24485607"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maher75017/exact-exp32"
abstract: "Correctly rounded exp2f, expf, exp10f and logf without a rounding test on the CPU, a float-only correctly rounded exp2f on an NVIDIA GPU (RTX 5090), and a Koza-style genetic-programming search on the GPU for faster exact code. Every candidate is checked on all 2^32 inputs."
keywords:
  - correctly rounded
  - elementary functions
  - exhaustive testing
  - floating point
  - CUDA
  - genetic programming
